    {
      "text": "Three road security personnel were killed on Tuesday during an attack by unidentified gunmen in the Hama countryside of central Syria, according to the North Press Agency. A security source told Syria’s Al-Ikhbariya TV that security forces have been mobilized to investigate the incident and pursue those involved. At the time of publication, the Internal Security Forces had not issued an official statement regarding the attack."
    }
